# Finite coherent STA TSF snapshot. The four-case profile closes both optional
# output-pointer branches and compares the scratch writes and ordered MMIO.
default-disposition not-yet-ported
default-protocol wifi

function rom hal_get_sta_tsf
disposition direct
protocol wifi
rust-component open_esp_radio_esp32s31_pac::RadioRegisters::station_tsf
binding v1
rust-probe open_rom_power_tsf_trace_hal_get_sta_tsf
effect-contract exact-effects-v1
effect mmio-read 32 0x2010d814 required
effect mmio-write 32 0x2010d814 required
effect mmio-read 32 0x2010d820 required
effect mmio-read 32 0x2010d824 required
